<title>USA: Saudi oil minister to speak at API annual meeting.</title>
<headline>Saudi oil minister to speak at API annual meeting.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's Minister of Petroleum and Mineral Resources will be one of the speakers at the American Petroleum Institute's annual meeting here, the API said.</p>
<p>Ali Ibrahim Naimi is to speak Monday, November 11, at the general opening session, an API spokeswoman said. She said she did not yet know his topic.</p>
<p>A Saudi oil minister last spoke at an API annual meeting in 1987, she said.</p>
